{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0501","text":"Мне нравится моя работа.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"work","license":"original","batch_index":5}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0502","text":"У меня совещание в три.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"work","license":"original","batch_index":5}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0503","text":"Начальник в командировке.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"work","license":"original","batch_index":5}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0504","text":"Я работаю в офисе два года.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"work","license":"original","batch_index":5}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0505","text":"Письмо было отправлено вовремя.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"work","license":"original","batch_index":5}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0506","text":"Все документы в порядке.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"work","license":"original","batch_index":5}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0507","text":"Собрание началось вовремя.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"work","license":"original","batch_index":5}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0508","text":"Задание выполнено в срок.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"work","license":"original","batch_index":5}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0509","text":"Пришли мне файл по почте.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"work","license":"original","batch_index":5}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0510","text":"Я занят до пяти.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"work","license":"original","batch_index":5}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0511","text":"Работа кипит.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"idiom","license":"original","batch_index":5}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0512","text":"Он мастер на все руки.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"idiom","license":"original","batch_index":5}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0513","text":"Проект реализован успешно.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"false_friend","license":"original","batch_index":5}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0514","text":"Это актуальная проблема.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"false_friend","license":"original","batch_index":5}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0515","text":"Это перспективная должность.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"false_friend","license":"original","batch_index":5}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0516","text":"Дедлайн завтра, торопитесь!","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"work","license":"original","batch_index":5}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0517","text":"Несмотря на усилия, проект провалился.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"work","license":"original","batch_index":5}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0518","text":"Он уволился по собственному желанию.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"work","license":"original","batch_index":5}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0519","text":"Заявление подано вовремя.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"work","license":"original","batch_index":5}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0520","text":"Переговоры прошли успешно.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"work","license":"original","batch_index":5}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0521","text":"Зарплата выплачивается в конце месяца.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"work","license":"original","batch_index":5}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0522","text":"Он работает без выходных.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"work","license":"original","batch_index":5}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0523","text":"Отчёт готов к сдаче.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"work","license":"original","batch_index":5}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0524","text":"В компании сменилось руководство.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"work","license":"original","batch_index":5}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0525","text":"Сотрудник получил повышение.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"work","license":"original","batch_index":5}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0526","text":"Взять быка за рога.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"idiom","license":"original","batch_index":5}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0527","text":"Конференция прошла на высоком уровне.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"work","license":"original","batch_index":5}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0528","text":"Новый сотрудник быстро вошёл в курс дела.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"work","license":"original","batch_index":5}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0529","text":"Клиент остался недоволен сервисом.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"work","license":"original","batch_index":5}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0530","text":"Задача поставлена неправильно.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"work","license":"original","batch_index":5}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0531","text":"Он хватается за всё и ничего не доделывает.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"work","license":"original","batch_index":5}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0532","text":"Договор подписан обеими сторонами.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"work","license":"original","batch_index":5}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0533","text":"Офис находится в центре города.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"work","license":"original","batch_index":5}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0534","text":"Обучение проходит онлайн.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"work","license":"original","batch_index":5}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0535","text":"Он работает на удалёнке.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"work","license":"original","batch_index":5}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0536","text":"Проект завершён в срок.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"work","license":"original","batch_index":5}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0537","text":"Ему предложили контракт на год.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"work","license":"original","batch_index":5}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0538","text":"Отдел маркетинга подготовил презентацию.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"work","license":"original","batch_index":5}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0539","text":"Рабочий день заканчивается в шесть.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"work","license":"original","batch_index":5}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0540","text":"Корпоратив состоится в пятницу.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"work","license":"original","batch_index":5}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0541","text":"Он всегда приходит вовремя.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"work","license":"original","batch_index":5}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0542","text":"Коллектив дружный и трудолюбивый.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"work","license":"original","batch_index":5}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0543","text":"Нам нужен опытный специалист.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"work","license":"original","batch_index":5}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0544","text":"Бизнес-план одобрен инвестором.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"work","license":"original","batch_index":5}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0545","text":"Совет директоров принял решение.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"work","license":"original","batch_index":5}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0546","text":"Продажи выросли на двадцать процентов.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"work","license":"original","batch_index":5}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0547","text":"Итоговый отчёт будет готов в понедельник.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"work","license":"original","batch_index":5}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0548","text":"Стажёр справился с задачей.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"work","license":"original","batch_index":5}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0549","text":"Конкуренты выпустили новый продукт.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"work","license":"original","batch_index":5}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0550","text":"Мы выходим на новые рынки.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"work","license":"original","batch_index":5}
